
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tara AI Study Tutor</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f0f4ff;
      color: #1e293b;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      padding: 30px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px #00000010;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #4f46e5;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    button {
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    #message {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome to Tara AI Study Tutor</h1>

    <p>
      Your AI Voice Tutor and AI Book Reader project
      is now ready to begin!
    </p>

    <p>
      अब आप हिंदी और अंग्रेज़ी में पढ़ाई के लिए
      अपनी वेबसाइट तैयार कर सकते हैं।
    </p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">
      Get Started
    </button>

    <p id="message"></p>
  </div>

  <script>
    function showMessage() {
      document.getElementById("message").textContent =
        "Welcome! Tara AI Study Tutor is working.";
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
